### health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### list the offers a reservation can be bundled with (id, name, price)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/offers

### create a reservation (returns reservation, viewUrl and qr data url)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rey Mart",
  "phone": "+639275725348",
  "email": "samgyup199@gmail.com",
  "datetime": "2026-10-14T19:00",
  "guests": 4,
  "tableId": "t2",
  "offerId": "offer-1",
  "special": "Window seat if possible"
}

### list reservations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reservations

### get one reservation (replace REPLACE_ID with a real id)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reservations/REPLACE_ID

### download the QR as PNG (replace REPLACE_ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/reservations/REPLACE_ID/qr.png

### open the public view page (replace REPLACE_ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/r/REPLACE_ID

### delete a reservation (replace REPLACE_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/reservations/REPLACE_ID